{"slug":"2024-ca-mortar-void-identification-for-ballastless-track-using-1d-cnn","title_zh":"基于1D-CNN的无砟轨道CA砂浆脱空识别","title_en":"CA mortar void identification for ballastless track using 1D-CNN","authors":["陈宪麦","李鑫海","徐磊","邓燚","黄厚龙","邓云强"],"year":2024,"journal":"铁道科学与工程学报","volume":"21","issue":"4","pages":"1645–1655","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20230843","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20230843","language":"zh","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"中文摘要"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"为解决水泥乳化沥青砂浆(CA砂浆)脱空位置识别的难题，提出考虑CA砂浆脱空的无砟轨道模型建模与计算方案。首先，基于CRTS I型板式无砟轨道“梁−板−板”建模理论，使用非线性弹簧模拟CA砂浆脱空病害，输入扣件支点反力作为模型的激励，得到监测点位的垂向加速度数据集。其次，通过对数据集缩放、添加噪声的方式进行数据增强，增强数据集的差异，以增强识别模型的泛化性，获得更加准确的识别结果。最后，建立脱空病害的识别方法，搭建一维卷积神经网络(1D-CNN)进行CA砂浆的脱空位置识别，构建准确率、查准率和查全率等评价指标评估识别结果，使用t-SNE降维算法对结果进行可视化。对比其他3种神经网络的表现，探讨1D-CNN应用于CA砂浆脱空位置识别的优势。研究结果表明：“梁−板−板”模型反映了无砟轨道的力学本征，用于CA砂浆脱空问题的仿真模拟是可行的；通过对数据集信号缩放、添加噪声的方式进行数据增强可提高深度学习模型的性能；从深度学习的角度来看，CA砂浆脱空发生在板中造成的危害较小，应重点关注板端CA砂浆脱空的养护与维修问题；1D-CNN相比其他3种模型运算时间短，在CA砂浆脱空位置识别数据集上优势更大，识别准确率可达95%以上。研究结果为进一步提高无砟轨道结构监测的自动化和智能化水平提供参考。"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"英文摘要"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"In order to solve the challenge of identifying the location of void in Cement-emulsified Asphalt mortar (CA mortar), a modeling and calculation scheme was proposed for ballastless tracks considering the CA mortar void. Based on the CRTS I slab ballastless track beam-shell modeling theory, a non-linear spring was used to simulate CA mortar void damage, and the fastener forces were input as the excitation of the model to obtain the vertical acceleration dataset at the monitoring points. Second, data augmentation was performed by scaling the sequences and adding noise to enhance the differences in the dataset. These approaches aimed to improve the recognition model to obtain more accurate recognition results. Finally, a method for the identification of voids was established. A one-dimensional Convolutional Neural Network (1D-CNN) was built to identify the location of CA mortar voids. Evaluation metrics such as accuracy, recall, and precision were constructed to assess the identification results and visualize the results using the t-SNE dimensionality reduction algorithm. The advantages of 1D-CNN applied to CA mortar void recognition were discussed by comparing the performance of the other 3 neural networks. The results show that the beam-shell model reflects the mechanical intricacies of the ballastless track and is feasible for the simulation of the CA mortar void problem. Data augmentation by scaling the dataset signal and adding noise can improve the performance of the deep learning model. From a deep learning perspective, the CA mortar void in the middle of the slab is less damaging and should focus on maintaining the CA mortar void at the slab end. 1D-CNN has a shorter running time compared with the other 3 models and has a greater advantage in the CA mortar void location identification dataset, with an identification accuracy of more than 95%. The results of the study provide a reference for further improving the automation and intelligence of ballastless track structure monitoring."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"**中文关键词：** 无砟轨道；有限元模型；CA砂浆；深度学习；脱空识别"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"**英文关键词：** ballastless track; finite element model; CA mortar; deep learning; void identification"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"研究思想"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"CA砂浆脱空会改变轨道板的支承状态，如何从振动响应中判断脱空位置，是无砟轨道结构监测的重要问题。已有冲击回波识别方法依赖试验信号，而车辆—轨道耦合实体单元模型生成训练数据的计算成本较高，噪声也增加了识别难度。论文将简化力学模型与数据驱动分类连接起来：先生成不同脱空位置下的垂向加速度，再让网络学习响应差异，避免人工指定损伤特征。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"梁板建模、非线性弹簧简化及卷积网络均有既有研究基础。本文的工作是将这些方法组织为面向CRTSⅠ型板式无砟轨道的仿真与识别流程，并比较1D-CNN与三种序列网络。识别目标是完好状态及三个脱空区域，不是同时预测脱空位置、面积与程度。"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"方法"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"text":"力学建模与荷载输入"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"模型在ABAQUS中以弹性板单元模拟轨道板和支撑层，忽略凸型挡台；支撑层取三块轨道板的长度，仅建立中间一块轨道板。下部基础按Winkler假定模拟，弹性地基系数为76 MPa/m，并排除其他基础病害。钢轨作用由外部车辆—轨道耦合程序计算的扣件支点反力代替，而非在梁板模型中直接求解车辆与轨道的耦合运动。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"完好砂浆用线性弹簧等效，脱空区域用仅在接触受压时起作用的非线性弹簧模拟。设置两个板端区域和一个板中区域，均沿横向贯通，纵向长度分别为908.5 mm和943.5 mm；每次只允许一个区域脱空，厚度方向脱空程度取20%、40%、60%、80%、100%，连同完好状态形成16种工况。"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"text":"数据生成与网络训练"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"采用CRH2动车、300 km/h运行速度及不同累积概率的轨道不平顺，生成30组扣件支点反力。保留原始荷载，并分别缩放至1.05、1.025、0.95和0.975倍后添加高斯白噪声或正余弦噪声，扩展为150组荷载。增强作用于荷载，随后重新计算加速度响应。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"轨道板两端及中间共布置9个监测点，每个样本包含各点512步垂向加速度，时间间隔为0.0012 s。150组荷载与16种工况组合，形成2 400×9×512的数据集，按70%、15%、15%划分训练、测试和验证集。五种脱空程度归入同一位置标签，最终为四分类任务。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"1D-CNN以三个卷积块提取时间序列特征，各块包含两次卷积和一次池化，随后展平并完成全连接分类。训练采用Leaky ReLU、交叉熵损失和Adam优化器，以验证集准确率控制早停止。混淆矩阵用于检查类别误判；t-SNE将四维输出概率映射到二维，辅助观察类别关系。"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"基本结论"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"在所构造的仿真数据集上，1D-CNN取得较好的位置分类表现。测试集四类查准率平均值为97.84%，查全率平均值为96.63%，F1平均值为97.21%；两个板端类别的三项指标均为100%。主要混淆发生于完好状态和板中脱空，说明这两类工况的加速度特征较接近。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"作者据此提出应重点关注板端脱空养护，并推断板中脱空危害较小。但分类相似性直接支持的是响应特征难以区分，尚不足以独立量化结构安全风险或确定维修优先级。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"与RNN、LSTM、GRU相比，1D-CNN在验证集上达到98%的准确率和0.088的损失值，参数量为110 548，少于三个对照网络。论文报告其运算时间较短，表明轻量级卷积模型适合这一较简单的数据集；该比较不能直接推广为任意网络配置下的效率优势。"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"算例与验证"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"验证包括仿真数据分类、四种网络对照及输出概率可视化。训练使用RTX4090 24GB GPU，批量大小128，初始学习率0.001，早停耐心值200；训练于第890轮结束，保存第690轮模型供测试。t-SNE采用PCA初始化、混乱度40，得到的板端类别簇较分离，完好与板中脱空类别边界存在误判，与混淆矩阵一致。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"研究未提供现场监测或实体脱空试验，也未展示该有限元模型与实测响应的直接校核。加噪扩充增加了仿真样本差异，但没有增强前后模型的独立对照，尚不能量化增强带来的增益；数据划分亦未说明是否按原始荷载及其增强样本分组。因此，结果主要说明模型在既定单区域脱空、固定速度和模拟噪声条件下的识别能力，对新线路、其他速度和多区域同时脱空的泛化仍待验证。"}],"glossary":[{"zh":"无砟轨道","en":"Ballastless track","explanation":"本文研究的轨道结构，采用CRTSⅠ型板式构造。","terms":[{"id":"Cfec996ddfd0482dc3634","zh":"无砟轨道","en":"ballastless track","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H833faff8edfc3e1eaa8a","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"Waca09c38621fc5d8bdfeb648","group_id":"Waca09c38621fc5d8bdfeb648","zh":"无砟轨道","en":"","name":"无砟轨道","language":"zh","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","domains":["车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","车辆轨道基础结构动力学","轨道结构与动力学"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"core","families":[]},"en":{"id":"W4363b12347fe766a586ac145","group_id":"W4363b12347fe766a586ac145","zh":"","en":"ballastless track","name":"ballastless track","language":"en","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","domains":["车辆轨道基础结构动力学","轨道结构与动力学"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"core","families":[]}}},{"zh":"水泥乳化沥青砂浆","en":"Cement-emulsified asphalt mortar (CA mortar)","explanation":"轨道板下的填充材料，其脱空改变层间支承状态。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"Wde118ec686a4857391f4e969","group_id":"Wde118ec686a4857391f4e969","zh":"水泥乳化沥青砂浆","en":"","name":"水泥乳化沥青砂浆","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]},"en":{"id":"W1775dee47465676826639403","group_id":"W1775dee47465676826639403","zh":"","en":"Cement-emulsified asphalt mortar (CA mortar)","name":"Cement-emulsified asphalt mortar (CA mortar)","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"脱空识别","en":"Void identification","explanation":"根据垂向加速度判断完好状态或脱空所在区域。","terms":[{"id":"C2be9474250462918907f","zh":"脱空识别","en":"void identification","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H3dc19405cc45a07b2bba","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"W9ca464fe3284faa17b1bd554","group_id":"W9ca464fe3284faa17b1bd554","zh":"脱空识别","en":"","name":"脱空识别","language":"zh","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","domains":["轨道结构与动力学"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":"C2be9474250462918907f","scope":"core","families":[]},"en":null}},{"zh":"有限元模型","en":"Finite element model","explanation":"计算不同脱空工况下轨道板动力响应的数据生成模型。","terms":[{"id":"C1b3092e686709cdfb17b","zh":"有限元模型","en":"finite element model","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"Hda366f28326fe818c92d","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"W0f6260f4422d913a182239f3","group_id":"W0f6260f4422d913a182239f3","zh":"有限元模型","en":"","name":"有限元模型","language":"zh","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","domains":["轨道结构与动力学"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":"C1b3092e686709cdfb17b","scope":"core","families":[]},"en":null}},{"zh":"梁板模型","en":"Beam-plate model","explanation":"简化轨道结构受力关系，并以板单元及等效弹簧实现计算。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"W63b7cb6f615795bf7ad9eb24","group_id":"W63b7cb6f615795bf7ad9eb24","zh":"梁板模型","en":"","name":"梁板模型","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]},"en":null}},{"zh":"非线性弹簧","en":"Nonlinear spring","explanation":"模拟脱空区域仅在层间接触受压后产生作用的连接。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"W034effee2cc7c57b78a42556","group_id":"W034effee2cc7c57b78a42556","zh":"非线性弹簧","en":"","name":"非线性弹簧","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]},"en":null}},{"zh":"扣件支点反力","en":"Fastener force","explanation":"由车辆—轨道耦合程序计算，作为梁板模型的外部激励。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"W523a91fe3fe915520e51f54a","group_id":"W523a91fe3fe915520e51f54a","zh":"扣件支点反力","en":"","name":"扣件支点反力","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]},"en":null}},{"zh":"车辆—轨道耦合动力学","en":"Vehicle-track coupled dynamics","explanation":"用于计算列车运行过程中车辆与轨道相互作用及扣件荷载。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"W485e0636cd9f41b72a5bec2d","group_id":"W485e0636cd9f41b72a5bec2d","zh":"车辆—轨道耦合动力学","en":"","name":"车辆—轨道耦合动力学","language":"zh","domain":"系统与动力学","domains":["系统与动力学","车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"core","families":[]},"en":null}},{"zh":"轨道不平顺","en":"Track irregularity","explanation":"生成不同扣件支点反力的输入，包括高低、轨向、水平和轨距不平顺。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":{"id":"W0b390be60b54ddc4030f41a4","group_id":"W0b390be60b54ddc4030f41a4","zh":"轨道不平顺","en":"","name":"轨道不平顺","language":"zh","domain":"轨道几何","domains":["轨道几何"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","scope":"core","families":[{"id":"geometry.irregularity","label":"轨道不平顺及其表征"}]},"en":null}},{"z